<title>Czech Republic: Czech RPIX closes higher, activity moderate.</title>
<headline>Czech RPIX closes higher, activity moderate.</headline>
<text>
<p>1200 GMT - Czech RPIX closes up in moderate activity.</p>
<p>*  RPIX up 3.0 points, 0.29 percent, to 1,024.4.</p>
<p>* Turnover, 22.5 million crowns.</p>
<p>* Komercni Banka rises 10 crowns to 1,740. Most heavily traded share with turnover at 8.7 million crowns.</p>
<p>* CEZ gains four crowns to 905.</p>
<p>-- Robin Shepherd, Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
